// into `m`'s cache slot when it produced no lex diags. The hit is the ordinary
// path — `modScan` banked the stream at commit time — so the miss covers a
// module the scan skipped (`found == 0`) or one whose lex diags made it
// unbankable, and those must still reach `vcLoadToks` to fold their diags.
