// mechanism not semantics) type-annotation references and type declaration names,
// since the native checker resolves type names from the merged program. A top-level
// name shadowed by a param, loop var or block-local `let`/`function` is left alone for
// that scope's extent (`modShadow`, a save/restore stack).
