// Rename every TYPE-position identifier in the subtree rooted at `root` — the head of
// a `TS_NAME` / `TS_APP`, a `TS_MAP`'s KEY — skipping a live generic type-parameter
// (`modTyShadow`). What the TREE knows and the segment scanner cannot: `TS_FIELD.tsText`
// is a FIELD name and `TS_LITSTR`/`TS_LITNUM` are lexemes, so neither can be renamed.
